if {gameEnd} == false:
	Skunk: Not everyone deserves a cup, you know.
else:
	Skunk: …Well, that’s acceptable. The town feels… better, I guess.
if {bearOpen} == true and {bearSkunk} == false:
	- Skunk… thought you’d approve of this. Don’t tell me if it’s too much sugar.
		Skunk: …Not bad, actually. I’ll allow it.
		set {bearSkunk} = true
	- Later!
[signal arg="dialogue_end"]